{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Observation\nDependabot Updates run 41918750684 (weekly uv version update, 2026-11-04 13:43 PST), the first uv run after the uv floor landed (e0ab18822c6), ran uv 0.13.5 with no tool_version_not_supported error, built 25 dependency changes in group 'uv-lock', then `POST /update_jobs/1681618238/create_pull_request` returned 400: 'The request contains invalid or unauthorized changes' (recorded as dependency_file_not_supported). No pull request was opened. The log does not name the files in the rejected payload. Earlier uv runs never reached this step: uv refused the exact pin before any update ran.\n## Testing\n\nChecked: the Dependabot uv run triggered by the dependabot.yml change (`gh run view <id> --log`) shows exclude-paths in the job definition, no release-requirements recompile, no create_pull_request 400, and an opened uv-lock group pull request.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] [non-codebase] Root cause of the 400 identified from evidence (which file or change Dependabot's API rejected), before any fix.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Dependabot Updates runs for navapbc/rebar; principal=gh CLI repo reader; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh run view --log of runs 41918750684 and 43105554680 (create_pull_request 400, .github/release-requirements.txt recompiled), recorded in ticket comments\n- [x] [non-codebase] A later Dependabot uv run opens the uv-lock group pull request or records no create_pull_request error.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Dependabot Updates run 43285155106 for navapbc/rebar; principal=gh CLI repo reader; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh run view --log (exclude-paths in job, no create_pull_request 400) and PR #147 opened, recorded in ticket comments"}},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1794518086355624001,"uuid":"eb0c8d99-5580-4502-8930-b15f388cef7b"}